                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex 8]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Statement by the Czechoslovak Delegation on Article
                        23, Paragraph 8b</hi></head>
                <p>“The Czechoslovak Delegation considers that by the inclusion of the words ‘a
                    United Nation’ into the text of sub-paragraph <hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>) of
                    paragraph 8, Article 23, Czechoslovakia will not be precluded by the time
                    periods of sub-paragraph <hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>) paragraph 8, Art. 23
                    from being the beneficiary of the rights ensuing from Article 23 in place of her
                    former citizens, who were Czechoslovak citizens before her occupation and who
                    ceased to be Czechoslovak citizens since Czechoslovakia’s liberation.”</p>
            </div>
